## Dependencies

Project Phoenix depends on the following systems:
- SAP ERP (for financial data integration)
- Salesforce CRM (for customer data)
- Legacy Data Warehouse (for historical data migration)
- Azure Active Directory (for authentication)

## Deliverables

1. Unified Data Platform
2. Real-time Analytics Dashboard
3. Data Governance Framework
4. API Integration Layer
5. Self-Service Reporting Portal

## Risks and Issues

- Risk: Legacy system compatibility - Mitigation: Parallel running period
- Risk: Data quality concerns - Mitigation: Data cleansing sprint
- Issue: Vendor contract delays - Resolution: Expedited procurement

